# --- generated datasets ------------------------------------------------------
# The labelled dataset is reproducible from a seed, so it is not tracked:
#   cd ai-service && python -m app.download_images --synthetic --per-class 60 --out ../data/images
# Regenerate it rather than committing 480 binaries. Real-photo datasets pulled
# from Openverse carry per-file CC provenance in manifest.json and should be
# stored outside Git (or via Git LFS) because of licence and size constraints.
data/images/
ai-service/data/
*.feature_cache.npy

# --- third-party imagery -----------------------------------------------------
# Product photos gathered from search/stock sites are used for cross-domain
# EVALUATION ONLY. They are third-party copyrighted works: keep them on disk,
# never in the repository. Rebuild with train/download or your own captures.
image-search/
ai-service/eval/real-photos/
!ai-service/eval/real-photos/README.md

# --- misc --------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
coverage/
